<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell 15 points to 1,326.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell 15 points to 1,326.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,326 today from 1,341 on July 23, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1428    12.964	  1442    13.088</p>
<p>   1a   1315  9957.000	  1329 10069.000</p>
